WEBVTT

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:35.170
Though Lieutenant Klim is asking
me to enlist in the Amerian Army,

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:38.130
as a Capital Guard cadet, I can't accept.

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:41.460
Although, when the Capital Army attacked,

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:43.630
I had no choice but to sortie.

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:46.050
I ended up going out in
just the Core Fighter,

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:48.550
and it turned into one hellish experience!

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:17.080
Main nozzle, cut.

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:22.710
Orbital speed, set.

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:26.510
Take care of meals and your other needs now.

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:30.140
The Capital Army are close enough
to attack at any time.

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:34.350
Dental gum. If that's not enough,
you can wash your mouth here.

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.100
What's wrong with it?

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:40.810
You need to massage your gums.

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:47.570
I know it doesn't massage
your gums, but...

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:48.910
Is it itchy?

00:02:50.490 --> 00:02:53.080
- Hey!
- ﻿Huh?

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:56.450
- What?
- ﻿When do we escape?

00:02:56.460 --> 00:03:00.330
We haven't confirmed the Amerian
space fleet's numbers yet.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:03.710
So you haven't forgotten you're
a Capital Guard cadet after all.

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:06.460
Agh! Take it off!

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:11.390
You need to keep the helmet on for now!

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:13.140
We might be going outside!

00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:16.470
Are you thinking of escaping in the G-Self?

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:20.060
Happa plans to send me out there.

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:23.270
I'll be going out in the G-Arcane this time.

00:03:23.270 --> 00:03:25.150
Even though we're in space?

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:26.530
You're being reckless.

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:29.530
What is this?

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:35.950
Why has it come to this?

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:42.580
Are all these boosters and Mobile Suits

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:46.380
really necessary just to
deal with space pirates?

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:48.510
Now that we know the pirates
are with the Amerian Army,

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:52.220
it's necessary to field a unit of
at least the Gironde Team's scale.

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:55.640
Captain Dellensen has
arrived at the Under Nut.

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:56.770
Okay.

00:03:56.770 --> 00:04:00.020
What do you think you're
doing at Capital Tower?

00:04:00.020 --> 00:04:03.060
We're just launching the captain's Elf Bull.

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:04.980
Huh? Surely you jest!

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:06.820
Hmph, old hag.

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:27.750
Good to have you here, Sir.

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:33.340
It seems the Gironde Team has sortied.

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:36.390
Can we trust the reports from Mask?

00:04:36.390 --> 00:04:39.270
This operation was planned with
lessons learned from his mistakes.

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:41.140
It should be perfect.

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:45.150
Mask was using the first MP unit
based on the Elf Bull...

00:04:45.150 --> 00:04:46.360
Did he get too carried away?

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:55.370
With this operation, I will
rescue my student, Bellri Zenam!

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:07.920
You know the Capital Army?

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:10.340
I don't like them. At all.

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:15.090
They were originally just a bunch
of Capital Guard guys anyways!

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:27.440
Just now, we received a transmission
from the Capital Tower control room.

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:28.770
From the surface, huh?

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:34.030
You've turned the Under Nut
into a military base.

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:40.740
The Amerian pirates are battle hardened
from 20 years of war with Gondwan.

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:43.500
- Director.
- ﻿Huh?

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:46.540
I will see to it that your
son comes back safely.

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:48.960
You will, Captain Dellensen? Yourself?

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:52.090
This is a battle to restore our honor!

00:05:52.090 --> 00:05:53.800
Restore your honor?

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:56.050
This is the Capital Army's business, so—

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:01.350
Captain, you can link up with
the Gironde Team, right?

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:05.310
It seems I can trace them, but are
you sure this data isn't wrong?

00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:06.980
It's not wrong.

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:09.810
You can handle the Elf Bull's
transformation, right?

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:15.650
Bellri Zenam, hurry to your position.

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:16.860
I'm hurrying!

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:18.530
Noredo.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:21.080
What?

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:24.250
The Fry-Schops are connected
to the outside of the hangar.

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:27.170
I was told the G-Self will use
the one in the back right.

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:32.460
Raraiya, we should go pee.

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:34.420
What's wrong?

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:37.430
It's poop! It's poop! It's poop!

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:40.260
- Looks fine.
- ﻿Yeah.

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:43.640
The Megafauna still isn't
visible on the horizon.

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:44.850
That's just fine.

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:47.270
You don't mind them installing that?

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:48.310
I don't really mind.

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:51.230
Though if it just makes the unit heavier,
I won't be happy about it.

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:57.280
That was built by Ameria's best engineers
at the Caribbean Ocean Laboratory.

00:06:57.950 --> 00:06:59.740
It reflects beams.

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:01.870
They were unable to install
one on the Montero!

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:04.330
Don't be bitter, Lieutenant.

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:06.450
We're counting on you, kid!

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:08.120
This isn't funny!

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:10.420
It's like you're using me as a guinea pig!

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:13.960
You may be facing an all-out war in space,

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:15.340
so we thickened your defenses.

00:07:15.590 --> 00:07:16.670
Okay!

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:19.090
The controller for the
Reflector is external,

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:21.720
so check the manual on how to use it.

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:24.260
For the gauge and how to activate it.

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:25.600
R-Right!

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:28.520
Captain Dellensen, I'll be counting on you.

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:29.600
Leave it to me!

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:31.850
We're off!

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:42.280
To control the Reflector...

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:44.620
This activates it,

00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:46.910
and I can bring up the manual over here.

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:49.370
Since they gave you the Reflector,

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:51.920
I expect you to act as my shield.

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:54.840
Since the Megafauna is flying
on a sub-orbital course...

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:56.750
You can hear me over the contact link, right?

00:07:57.300 --> 00:08:00.260
If you carelessly get too far away,
you'll go into freefall.

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:03.260
I've done practical training on
a high-altitude glider before!

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:05.140
And if you'll be acting
as a beam shield—

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:09.890
Inspector General Surugan wants our research
on UC era authentication methods expedited.

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:12.270
- I keep telling Father that.
- Noredo and Raraiya...

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:14.610
I hope they snuck aboard all right.

00:08:14.610 --> 00:08:16.270
Get in further.

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:24.490
They say they want the G-Self to go out
and intercept the enemy at this altitude.

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:27.950
That Capital Guard kid seems like
he might just be able to handle it.

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:29.700
Think this'll work out?

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:36.670
What is the Gironde Team's position?

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:41.630
If the Gironde Team can just drive
the pirate ship up from below,

00:08:41.630 --> 00:08:43.220
I, the unworthy Dellensen,

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:46.680
will rescue Bellri and the two others
held captive on the pirate ship,

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:49.100
and take back the G-Self as well!

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:51.520
You got that, Gironde Team?

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:55.940
The problem is that the pirate ship is
raising its altitude more than we thought.

00:08:56.610 --> 00:09:01.280
That's something we've
known from the beginning!

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:05.740
From here on, we won't be
able to communicate by radio.

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:08.120
Don't any of you lose sight of the Megafauna!

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:14.330
Mr. Adam Smith is more
considerate than he looks.

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:16.380
Fry-Schop, go on ahead!

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:24.260
They're definitely used to being in space.

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:25.720
When you aren't using the Reflector...

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:26.760
Huh?

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:29.100
When you aren't using it, make it smaller.

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:30.350
Fold it up!

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:32.100
I know!

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:47.820
G-Self, are you reading
me over the contact link?

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:49.740
Yes, I read you!

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:53.080
Bellri's here.

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:56.540
We know you're good at this.

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.500
Try to make sure nothing goes wrong, okay?

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:00.210
Roger.

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:02.260
I'm not keen on dying either.

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:04.300
I have to fight a high-altitude battle?

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:07.760
It's tuned perfectly, huh?

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:11.640
<i>﻿If I fall from this height, it'll be hell.</i>

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:15.100
We're going to close in on them
while facing the Capital Tower!

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:16.730
Roger that, but...

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:24.780
What's wrong? What is it?

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:26.740
Oh, air!

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:29.410
Raraiya!

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.830
Environment check! Environment check!

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:38.080
Don't talk!

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:39.790
Environment check clear!

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:41.500
Hold it in for now!

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:43.670
Hold it! Hold it in the whole time...

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:46.920
The whole time... The whole time...

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:56.560
This isn't how they said it'd be!

00:10:56.980 --> 00:10:59.350
The pirate ship's launched F-Rugs!

00:10:59.730 --> 00:11:02.650
Do they plan to intercept the Elf Bull?

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:04.980
The enemy is battle hardened!

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:08.280
We'll rain missiles on the pirate
ship to divert their attention.

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:09.740
Will they reach from here?

00:11:09.740 --> 00:11:11.490
We're almost in firing range.

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:14.240
Radio is jammed!

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:17.040
I can't believe this!

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:19.750
Five unknowns are closing in from below us.

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:21.000
Steer!

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:24.630
Expect long-range missiles to
come from Capital Tower as well!

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:25.800
Yes, sir!

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:32.050
If we attack, the Capital won't notice
when Ameria's space fleet moves.

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:34.760
The reason we put a
Reflector on the G-Self...

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:36.930
Was so that we could put
on a big flashy show here.

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:39.140
Lieutenant Klim, you read me?

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:43.150
Be prepared to battle in freefall.

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:45.520
But of course.

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:51.410
Miss Aida, your duty is to assist the G-Self.

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:54.660
Be sure that you do not go to the front.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:56.950
Thank you, Donyell.

00:11:57.750 --> 00:12:00.290
The G-Self is being forced
to carry a thing like that.

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:30.820
You know there's something approaching
from Capital Tower, yeah?

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:33.160
I'm concerned by the fact it's not a ship.

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:35.120
You still want to ascend more?

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:36.660
Yes. please.

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:40.960
Are you trying to use up all of our
propellant before the battle even starts?

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:43.500
What's wrong?

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:45.500
She stood! She's standing!

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:47.090
Hey, you're right.

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:50.220
Correcting gyro. Correcting gyro.

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:52.890
Is this girl turning lucid?

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:57.430
The G-Self jumped!

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:07.520
In order to photograph the other
side of the arctic horizon...

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:13.740
Confirm unfolding.

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:15.410
Activate camera.

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:18.370
Wow! I can see it!

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:21.750
Three... four... five ships!

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:23.040
These are the warships' silhouettes.

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:26.040
It's the Amerian Army's space fleet.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:28.800
They're in geocentric orbit.

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:32.300
G-Self, unknown inbound from above.

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:34.680
This piece of metal is a storage medium...

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:38.390
Saving data...

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:40.180
It worked!

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:44.440
Minovsky Particles have been dispersed?

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:52.570
Prepare intercept missiles
to fire in all directions!

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:54.820
There are unknowns coming
up from below as well!

00:13:55.280 --> 00:13:57.120
Deploy a barrier across
the bottom of the ship!

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:58.620
It's a bit early for that, isn't it?

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:00.290
What? Is it?

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:02.450
Though the one above does concern me,

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:05.420
the team forcing us upward
from below is a nuisance.

00:14:11.340 --> 00:14:13.220
Captain Dellensen has engaged!

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:15.220
But they've sent out Mobile Suits—

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:18.140
We will adhere to the
operation to rescue Bellri!

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:21.640
We're in range. Firing missiles!

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:25.690
Heat source, incoming!

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:26.980
Steer, accelerate!

00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:28.190
Yes, sir!

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:37.410
It's no good. We've reached
the Doubey's maximum altitude.

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:48.500
The Minovsky Particles were
spread by the one above!

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:00.890
What the heck?!

00:15:00.890 --> 00:15:03.220
If that's how powerful the Reflector is...!

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:12.400
There's one unit that came
from the pirate ship.

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:14.820
It's silhouette is different
on the camera, but...

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:16.820
That's the G-Self!

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:19.950
Is it completely under pirate control now?

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:25.910
You're trying to ram me?!

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:37.420
Here it comes!

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:50.770
It's converting the enemy's
beams into energy for me?

00:15:50.770 --> 00:15:51.810
In that case...!

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:02.410
Side nozzles, fire, fire, fire!

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:08.040
Steer, well done!

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:11.210
I'll leave anti-air fire
to individual discretion

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:12.330
Fine.

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:15.250
Should we have Miss Aida return?

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:17.510
If the Megafauna is safe,

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:20.760
I will be heading to support the student
engaged in Mobile Suit combat above!

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:23.510
You people go support the Megafauna!

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:29.270
Do you have any idea how many of
my comrades in arms you've killed?!

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:43.120
The Reflector is functioning.

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:43.910
Then...!

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:53.040
That should have been a direct hit!
What kind of monster are you?!

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:59.460
To think the Capital Army
constructed a thing like that...

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:03.050
Mom, you're way too ignorant of
what the Capital Army is doing!

00:17:09.230 --> 00:17:10.730
Have you not noticed?

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:12.640
G-Self, you're falling!

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:20.240
From another direction?!

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:27.370
A beam...

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:31.750
Is it the G-Self?!

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:35.830
Lieutenant, kick him away with your legs!

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:40.590
Did Bellri ram him?!

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:42.170
What?!

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:45.550
He's fast! But...!

00:17:51.180 --> 00:17:53.440
Wh-What's going on?

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:56.940
What is this?

00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:03.530
You were Bellri?

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:06.160
Instructor Dellensen?

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:12.790
This happened because you
brought out that new model!

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:15.460
It happened because you
transformed with that thing!

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:19.170
Because you resorted to
cheap tricks like that...!

00:18:26.090 --> 00:18:29.010
What happened to Lieutenant Klim?

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:33.140
The Reflector Gauge is fully charged.

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:36.980
The Lieutenant was damaged,
and should be falling...

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:38.940
Ah, is that him?

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:43.820
Why don't the guys in the Doubey notice?

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:50.990
With the Reflector fully
charged, the G-Self can...

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.830
The controls refuse to work!

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:58.750
How long can this machine hold?

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:00.960
The internal temperature is rising.

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:05.340
For me, a purposeless death is not an option!

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:10.470
What? What is that light?

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:24.150
This flow of gas is shielding us?

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.150
Lieutenant, are you okay?

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:28.910
What did you have the G-Self do?

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:30.410
No clue.

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:32.620
Try asking Happa.

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:34.870
I'm cutting off the Reflector System.

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:46.920
Did the Doubey unit down below just
arbitrarily decide to retreat?

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:50.010
Those guys took the F-Rug to its limits.

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:51.760
Are you really complaining?

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:53.970
I see.

00:19:54.680 --> 00:19:56.310
I suppose you're right.

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:58.730
This is ridiculous!

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:01.400
- ﻿It couldn't have been him!
- ﻿What are you doing, boy?

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:03.110
Turn on reverse thrusters!

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:06.280
Oh, right!

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:18.910
Both the Montero and the
G-Self have been damaged!

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:21.370
It's impressive they came back like that.

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:22.630
It's because it's Bellri!

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:24.290
What?

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:25.500
Where did you come from?

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:26.710
Who are you?

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:29.130
If I don't see for myself how good you are,

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:31.220
I'll be worried sick when things get tough.

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:32.680
Why you!

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:33.890
Chuchumy.

00:20:33.890 --> 00:20:34.850
Poop! Poop!

00:20:35.220 --> 00:20:36.520
You're right.

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:39.100
We'll need to change the ball's water.

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:44.060
We've come down over the ocean.

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:46.610
Return to Bequest Island at once.

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:50.450
Yes, sir. All hands.
continue monitoring below.

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:52.860
Switching to Minovsky Flight.

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:54.450
Keeping her steady.

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:56.540
I've made it so you can see.

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:58.200
Thankee!

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:03.170
This is the transforming Mobile Suit that
flew directly from Capital Tower, huh?

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:06.130
Is it the same model as the one
from the other day, you think?

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:08.050
I'm not sure on that.

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:11.840
Captain, please let Bellri Zenam rest.

00:21:11.840 --> 00:21:14.050
Yes, you're right.

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:15.220
Bellri.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:17.970
Pardon me.

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:24.900
I am quite impressed with him.

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:27.650
So the Reflector was effective.

00:21:27.650 --> 00:21:31.070
Bellri was using it for the
first time, you realize?

00:21:31.990 --> 00:21:33.610
Yes, you're right.

00:21:33.610 --> 00:21:36.570
And the main body is just barely scratched.

00:21:37.490 --> 00:21:42.040
I should say our manufacturing abilities
are deserving of some praise as well.

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:49.550
I just misheard.

00:21:50.260 --> 00:21:51.670
I must have!

00:21:54.430 --> 00:21:56.300
Look! Chuchumy!

00:21:56.930 --> 00:21:58.100
Look!

00:21:59.640 --> 00:22:00.600
Yeah.

00:22:00.600 --> 00:22:01.780
...you fool!

00:22:05.860 --> 00:22:07.150
It can't be true!

00:22:09.190 --> 00:22:11.740
It can't have been Instructor Dellensen!

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:14.030
It's not true!

00:22:17.870 --> 00:22:19.950
It's Chuchumy, Aida.

00:22:19.950 --> 00:22:21.160
It sure is.

00:24:02.140 --> 00:24:04.220
After being egged into it by the genius Klim,

00:24:04.220 --> 00:24:06.930
Raraiya pilots the G-Self.

00:24:06.930 --> 00:24:10.810
And, right then, a team of
transforming Mobile Suits attacks,

00:24:10.810 --> 00:24:13.150
so I got aboard the G-Self.

00:24:13.770 --> 00:24:16.610
But, that's not enough to win.

00:24:17.900 --> 00:24:20.450
On the next episode of Reconguista in G,

00:24:20.450 --> 00:24:22.820
The Mask Corps's Fierce Assault.

00:24:22.820 --> 00:24:24.870
I bet you wanna watch what happens!
